{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a sheepdog that can herd anything. Good thing too becuz there's a mess of animals, cars, trains, babies, and grandma's causing mayhem in the world. You're gonna do something about it aren't you? AREN'T YOU?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutie Crowd Control is an animal herding game where you need to get the animals to safety by crossing levels FILLED with ridiculous ways to die. Your scored on how many animal in your herd actually make it across to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HERD ANYTHING</strong> - you are a hero dog that can herd anything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HILARIOUS WAYS TO DIE</strong> - worlds full of dangerous and ridiculous traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE THE CUTIES</strong> - a bunch of cutie and too-dumb-to-survive lil derps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK NEW CHARACTERS</strong> to play as (Red Panda anyone?)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405290/extras/110a3da3b47b3ade6de871841a329a85.poster.avif?t=1761092331\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405290/extras/110a3da3b47b3ade6de871841a329a85.webm?t=1761092331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405290/extras/110a3da3b47b3ade6de871841a329a85.mp4?t=1761092331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK NEW CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you save those derpy lil cuties, you unlock new characters to play as.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_